# Oni horn markings
marking-OniHornSingleCurved = Single curved oni horn
marking-OniHornSingleLeftCurved = Single curved oni horn (left)
marking-OniHornSingleRightCurved = Single curved oni horn (right)
marking-OniHornDoubleCurvedOutwards = Double curved oni horns (outwards)
marking-OniHornDoubleCurved = Double curved oni horns
marking-OniHornDoubleLeftBrokeCurved = Double curved oni horns (left broken)
marking-OniHornDoubleRightBrokeCurved = Double curved oni horns (right broken)
